{% extends "base.jinja" %}
{% block title %}Privacy Policy - RankJee{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate text-slate-600 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <p>RankJee collects account information (name, email), learning activity (tests, scores, XP), wallet and payout-related data when you use earning features, and technical data (logs, IP) as needed to run the service securely.</p>
        <p>We use this data to operate the platform, personalize your experience, process rewards and withdrawals, and meet legal obligations. We do not sell your personal data.</p>
        <p>Payments and payouts may be processed via third parties (e.g. payment gateways, UPI). Those providers handle card/bank data under their own policies.</p>
        <p>You may request access or correction of your account data by contacting support. You can delete your account subject to legal/audit retention needs.</p>
        <p>This summary is not legal advice. For production, replace with counsel-reviewed text aligned with Indian law (including DPDP Act 2023).</p>
    </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
